      "created_at": "2014-12-15T19:26:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks Andy. The lack of response to anything was starting to get me down on what was already emotionally a pretty rough couple days. (Mostly hitting the end of cope with my kids, but a few other things, too.)</p><p>Assuming that my schedule permits, I plan to attend.</p><p>Most of the gaming I get to do is with kids (mine are ages 9 and 4.5), so I'll go farther by throwing out the following list of suggested titles:</p><ul>\n<li>King of Tokyo</li>\n<li>Castle Panic</li>\n<li>Forbidden Island/Desert</li>\n<li>Lords of Waterdeep for the older-ish set.</li>\n<li>Dungeon!</li>\n<li>Sentinels (of course)</li>\n<li>Scotland Yard</li>\n<li>Qwirkle</li>\n<li>Hey, that's my fish!</li>\n<li>Bang!</li>\n<li>Coloretto</li>\n<li>Race to Adventure!</li>\n<li>Ticket to Ride</li>\n<li>Hive</li>\n<li>your preferred theme of Zombie Dice. (I prefer Dino Hunt since one of mine is 4.5)</li>\n</ul>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:57:04.531Z",
