      "raw": "<p>Thanks Andy. The lack of response to anything was starting to get me down on what was already emotionally a pretty rough couple days. (Mostly hitting the end of cope with my kids, but a few other things, too.)</p><p>Assuming that my schedule permits, I plan to attend.</p><p>Most of the gaming I get to do is with kids (mine are ages 9 and 4.5), so I&#39;ll go farther by throwing out the following list of suggested titles:</p><ul><li>King of Tokyo</li><li>Castle Panic</li><li>Forbidden Island/Desert</li><li>Lords of Waterdeep for the older-ish set.</li><li>Dungeon!</li><li>Sentinels (of course)</li><li>Scotland Yard</li><li>Qwirkle</li><li>Hey, that&#39;s my fish!</li><li>Bang!</li><li>Coloretto</li><li>Race to Adventure!</li><li>Ticket to Ride</li><li>Hive</li><li>your preferred theme of Zombie Dice. (I prefer Dino Hunt since one of mine is 4.5)</li></ul>",
