      "raw": "<p>You rang?</p><p>Ok, so, this is definitely something we're going to give some thought to. The timing is the trickiest bit. Were I to be a fortune teller with a completely clear view of the future, I would likely say that this would happen sometime in the spring at the earliest. It would definitely be no earlier than the end of January, due to PAX South, and it's likely that it will have to wait until PAX East. But stay tuned. We like it.</p>",
